#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_identity_presence.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Identity and presence cover how you appear to other users: your nickname, NickServ login state, profile bio, away status, and personal user modes."
