"soprannome, NickServ stato di login, profilo bio, stato di distanza e "
"modalità utente personali."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_server_broadcasts.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In Admin Console > Broadcast, choose Wallops or Announce, enter a message, and send it through the same command handlers as /wallops and /announce."
